> <span begin="20.245" end="20.445">my</span> <span begin="20.445" end="20.885">friends</span> <span begin="20.885" end="21.285">said</span> <span begin="21.285" end="21.485">you</span> <span begin="21.485" end="22.025">moved</span> <span begin="22.025" end="22.225">out</span> <span begin="22.225" end="22.595">west</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">朋友们都说，你已在西边落脚</span></p><p begin="22.905" end="25.995" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.905" end="23.105">You</span> <span begin="23.105" end="23.525">tell</span> <span begin="23.525" end="23.685">me</span> <span begin="23.685" end="24.125">sto</span><span begin="24.125" end="24.465">ries</span> <span begin="24.465" end="24.785">under</span><span begin="24.785" end="25.145">neath</span> <span begin="25.145" end="25.565">sun</span><span begin="25.565" end="25.995">sets</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你在落日余晖里，向我细说往事</span></p><p begin="26.585" end="28.835" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.585" end="26.885">Could</span> <span begin="26.885" end="27.005">it</span> <span begin="27.005" end="27.225">be</span> <span begin="27.225" end="27.645">more</span> <span begin="27.645" end="27.845">than</span> <span begin="27.845" end="28.245">just</span> <span begin="28.245" end="28.485">one</span> <span begin="28.485" end="28.835">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一场相逢，能否不止今夜</span></p><p begin="29.095" end="30.465" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.095" end="29.415">Kiss</span> <span begin="29.415" end="29.535">in</span> <span begin="29.535" end="29.715">the</span> <span begin="29.715" end="30.175">cab</span> <span begin="30.175" end="30.465">ride</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">出租车里，交换一个吻</span></p><p begin="30.555" end="32.185" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.555" end="30.975">Head</span> <span begin="30.975" end="31.175">tur</span><span begin="31.175" end="31.455">ning</span> <spa